      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "2025"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Proud BNI Member , Creatox is proud to join BNI and become the Official Digital Media Partner of Grand Malabar Expo 2025."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "2026"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Creatox proudly steps into 2026 with the launch of our new office, marking a milestone in growth and innovation."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "How we works?"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "What started as a small idea has grown into a powerhouse of creativity and innovation."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "We are creative and believe in creativity as a force for good. We create positive impact and grow meaningful businesses through strong strategy, content and design."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "We are passionate people who believe in quality and innovation with many years of experience in building and using software solutions. We make sure to achieve your business goals."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "We believe that our success lies upon the skills and quality of our talented resources.Our detailed knowledge and understanding of Business, IT and Market Research helps us to contain the market competition."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "We firmly believe in building long-term relationships. We consider our customers as part of the extended Creatox family and work together as a team to serve them to best of our abilities."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Meet with our team member"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "What started as creative brainstorming has evolved into Creatox , a digital agency committed to helping brands grow, connect, and stand out."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Meet with our team member"
      }
